    'Loading sync settings': '正在載入同步設定',
    'Loading the folder saved for this task…': '正在讀取這個工作儲存的資料夾…',
    'Loading the location…': '正在讀取儲存位置…',
    'Local folder': '本機資料夾',
    'Local storage is not available right now, so the sync did not finish. Try again in a moment.':
        '本機儲存空間暫時無法使用，本次同步沒有完成。請稍後再試。',
    'Location check passed. No sync has started.': '位置檢查通過，尚未同步',
    'Location name': '同步位置名稱',
    'Location not saved. Make sure this task is not running, reopen this page and try again.':
        '位置未儲存。請確認這個工作沒有正在執行，再重新進入本頁試一次。',
    'Location not saved: the backup may be running, or it changed.':
        '位置沒有儲存：備份可能正在執行，或這份備份已被變更。',
    'Location saved. Go back to view the backup result.': '位置已儲存。備份結果請返回備份頁查看。',
    'Location updated. Check it again; only the folder was saved and no sync has started.':
        '儲存位置已更新，請重新檢查；本次只儲存資料夾，尚未同步。',
    'Logs and diagnostics contain no credentials, keys, original paths, profile identifiers, Velock data, or protected conflict details.':
        '記錄和診斷不包含憑證、金鑰、原始路徑、設定識別碼、格間業務內容或受保護的衝突詳情。',
    'Make sure the account can write to the target folder, not only read it.':
        '請確認帳號對目標資料夾有讀寫權限，而不是只有唯讀權限。',
    'Manage': '管理',
    'Manage securely in Velock': '在格間中安全管理',
    'Managed automatically, separate from your other files': '自動管理，不會和其他檔案混在一起',
