    'Start sync': '同期を開始',
    'Start the first sync when you are ready.': '準備ができたら、最初の同期を開始してください。',
    'Start with the address and scheme': 'まずアドレスとスキームを確認',
    'Started': '開始',
    'Starting folder ID (advanced)': '開始フォルダID（詳細）',
    'Step {0} of 3': 'ステップ {0}／3',
    'Stop transfers on this device through this connection. Local content and cloud backups will not be deleted.':
