    'Sync completed': '同期が完了しました',
    'Sync conflict needs attention': '同期の競合を確認してください',
    'Sync conflict to review': '確認が必要な同期の競合',
    'Sync details and settings': '同期の詳細と設定',
    'Sync did not complete. Check the sync profile and retry.':
